  - cn: "\u4F60\u8FD8\u60F3\u548C\u6211\u8BF4\u4EC0\u4E48\uFF1F"
    en: What else do you want to say to me?
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 2
    expression: 3
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
    audioEffect: 0
  - cn: "\u4F60\u6216\u8BB8\u4EE5\u4E3A\u81EA\u5DF1\u505A\u51FA\u4E86\u6700\u7406\u6027\uFF0C\u6700\u987E\u5168\u5927\u5C40\u7684\u51B3\u5B9A\u3002"
    en: Maybe you think you made the most rational decision, the decision that best
      considered the whole situation.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 2
    expression: 3
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
    audioEffect: 0
  - cn: "\u4F46\u5728\u6211\u770B\u6765\uFF0C\u4F60\u4E0D\u8FC7\u662F\u4E00\u4E2A\u81EA\u8D1F\u7684\u8822\u8D27\u3002"
    en: But to me, you are nothing more than an arrogant idiot.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 2
    expression: 3
