    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
    audioEffect: 0
  - cn: "\u5176\u5B9E\u4F60\u624D\u662F\u6211\u4EEC\u4E4B\u4E2D\u7B2C\u4E00\u4E2A\u75AF\u6389\u7684\u4EBA\u3002"
    en: In truth, you are the first one among us who went mad.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
